Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 12:18:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] feat(ai): wire Elixir AI into the document editor

Common.Controllers.ElixirAI adds the "Elixir" ribbon tab (Ask Elixir,
AI settings, AI journal) and binds Alt+I (Ctrl+Option+I on macOS, the
editor's convention for Alt shortcuts), which no editor shortcut uses;
Ctrl+K stays Insert hyperlink. The only hooks are the controller and
module declarations in app.js and app_dev.js.

[ai]

Assisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
